message: >-
  If you use Myanmar Glyph Studio, or publish a font built with it,
  please cite the software as below. Fonts themselves are released
  under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 with their own credits.
title: "Myanmar Glyph Studio"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Thiha Lynn"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Thiha-Lynn/myanmar-glyph-studio"
url: "https://thiha-lynn.github.io/myanmar-glyph-studio/"
license: MIT
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-08-13
keywords:
  - Myanmar script
  - Burmese
  - font
  - OpenType shaping
  - Unicode
  - UFO
  - fontmake
abstract: >-
  A browser-based font-creation studio for the Myanmar script:
  contributors trace glyphs over dimmed guide characters (phone,
  tablet with stylus, or desktop), and a Python toolchain generates
  OpenType shaping rules (mym2: blwf/rphf/pres/blws, GPOS mark/mkmk),
  UFO sources, and installable TTF/WOFF2 fonts with fontmake —
  covering the full Myanmar Unicode block plus Extended-A/B for
  Burmese, Mon, Shan, Karen, Kayah, Khamti and related languages.
